  │ Same size           (*) Ask  ( ) Overwrite  ( ) Skip  ( ) Keep both      │  
  ├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤  
  │ [x] Verify both to see if identical                                      │  
  │ Same                (*) Ask  ( ) Overwrite  ( ) Skip                     │  
